{
  "bodyHash": "e86dc16383f997c0",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>模组描述</strong></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Enhanced Netherite（增强下界合金）模组为游戏添加了一系列更强大的下界合金装备。</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>觉得物品太多？请查看 </strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/final-netherite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>最终下界合金 (Final Netherite)</strong></span></a></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Enhanced Netherite 与 Guns Without Roses 的联动插件，</strong></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhanced-netherite-guns-without-roses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>增强下界合金：无玫瑰枪械</strong></span></a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>腐化下界合金 (Corrupt Netherite)</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1555789/description_94ac08b6-b525-4175-8c1a-5fad95228398.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>护甲：</strong></span>降低玩家生命值，消耗“经验修补”附魔，玩家在受到伤害时自我修复。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>武器：</strong></span>根据玩家穿戴的腐化下界合金护甲增加伤害和抢夺等级，消耗“经验修补”附魔，玩家在受到伤害时自我修复。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>工具：</strong></span>根据玩家穿戴的腐化下界合金护甲增加效率等级，消耗“经验修补”附魔，玩家在受到伤害时自我修复。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#03404f\"><strong>回声下界合金 (Echo Netherite)</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1555789/description_0fbee997-87bf-40f4-b853-77ad48a8e0bc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>护甲：</strong></span>降低监守者造成的伤害，在深暗之域中再生生命值，灵魂绑定。</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">武器：</span></strong>增加对监守者的伤害，增加经验获取量，灵魂绑定。</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">工具：</span></strong>增加经验获取量，灵魂绑定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#11513f\"><strong>末影下界合金 (Ender Netherite)</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1555789/description_7897be8f-493f-4510-98a9-4ccc7ad9fcb1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>护甲：</strong></span>防止玩家掉入虚空，末影人始终保持被动。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>武器：</strong></span>增加对末影人的伤害，阻止末影人传送，将掉落物转移至绑定的箱子。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>工具：</strong></span>将掉落物转移至绑定的箱子。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>羽毛下界合金 (Feather Netherite)</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1555789/description_6655fc7e-89c3-4b3a-b385-772723a545aa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">护甲：</span></strong>减少跌落伤害，提供漂浮免疫。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>武器：</strong></span>吸引附近的掉落物。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>工具：</strong></span>吸引附近的掉落物。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>火焰下界合金 (Fire Netherite)</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1555789/description_7a275038-349a-4557-bf3e-b051352cdbaa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>护甲：</strong></span>提供火焰伤害免疫。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>武器：</strong></span>增加对燃烧目标的伤害，自动熔炼掉落物。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>工具：</strong></span>自动熔炼掉落物。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">黄金下界合金 (Gold Netherite)</span></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1555789/description_c7722a8a-179b-4e74-8746-95af9e25f434.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>护甲：</strong></span>类猪灵生物变为中立，增加幸运值。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>武器：</strong></span>增加对猪灵的伤害，增加抢夺等级。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>工具：</strong></span>增加效率等级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>幻翼下界合金 (Phantom Netherite)</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1555789/description_30dc8766-a8d1-47f8-ad1b-70b4b2fdeefc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>护甲：</strong></span>增加步高，提供幻翼伤害免疫。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>武器：</strong></span>增加对空中目标和幻翼的伤害，增加攻击距离。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>工具：</strong></span>增加攻击距离。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#082508\"><strong>剧毒下界合金 (Poison Netherite)</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1555789/description_f79fe87a-7e98-424b-9553-43f18531a01f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>护甲：</strong></span>提供中毒免疫，节肢动物伤害免疫。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>武器：</strong></span>攻击时施加中毒效果，增加对中毒生物的伤害。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>工具：</strong></span>攻击时施加中毒效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>水下界合金 (Water Netherite)</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1555789/description_9b6f01fc-7498-4f4d-8849-4dec49ca49ab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>护甲：</strong></span>提供挖掘疲劳免疫，增加游泳速度，无限氧气。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>武器：</strong></span>增加对未燃烧目标的伤害，增加对末影人的伤害。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>工具：</strong></span>增加水下挖掘速度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2d2d2d\"><strong>凋灵下界合金 (Wither Netherite)</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1555789/description_141981e2-b89c-4d8c-aef1-a1a1b718247b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>护甲：</strong></span>提供凋灵效果免疫，减少不死生物造成的伤害。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>武器：</strong></span>攻击时施加凋灵效果，增加对带有凋灵效果生物的伤害。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>装备：</strong></span>攻击时施加凋灵效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>未来计划：</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>添加更多工具，例如三叉戟、弓、盾牌等。</li>\n<li>添加终极下界合金，拥有所有增强下界合金变体的效果。</li>\n<li>与其他模组（如 Tetra）的交叉兼容性。</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
